<title>GREECE: Greece sells more than 350bln drs 2yr zeros - finmin.</title>
<headline>Greece sells more than 350bln drs 2yr zeros - finmin.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-05-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Greece sold more than 350 billion drachmas of two-year zero coupon notes to the public according to provisional figures, the finance ministry said in a statement.</p>
<p>The two-year zeros featuring a gross yield of 9.9 percent hit the market today.</p>
<p>Final figures will be available on Monday, it added. --Dimitris Kontogiannis, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
</text>
